---
// Static figure: three ways an early image gets a date, each drawn as a section. Left, charcoal in the paint itself is
// sampled (radiocarbon: a date for the pigment). Middle, a calcite crust that formed over the paint is sampled
// (uranium series: the crust's age, so a minimum age for the paint). Right, a marked object lies in a layer between
// dated layers (the date of the layer, not of the marks themselves). Simple drawings of relations, not of any one
// site. Uses the step layout of the stained-glass figure, in three columns.
---
<figure class="glass-steps three">
  <ol>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 120" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="dk-rock" d="M0 72 Q40 64 80 70 T160 68 V120 H0 Z" />
        <path class="dk-char" d="M26 69.5 Q50 64 80 69 T132 67.5" />
        <circle class="dk-sample" cx="80" cy="69" r="7" />
        <path class="dk-lead" d="M85 63 L104 40" />
        <rect class="dk-tag" x="104" y="30" width="34" height="12" rx="2" />
        <path class="dk-ink" d="M110 36 H132" />
      </svg>
      <p><strong>测颜料本身</strong>如果线条是用木炭画的，可以从颜料里取极少量的炭做放射性碳测年。得到的是这些炭的年代，最接近作画的时间。赭石等矿物颜料不含碳，就不能这样测。</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 120" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="dk-rock" d="M0 72 Q40 64 80 70 T160 68 V120 H0 Z" />
        <path class="dk-paint" d="M26 69.5 Q50 64 80 69 T132 67.5" />
        <path class="dk-crust" d="M48 66 Q64 58 82 62 Q100 64 112 63 Q100 70 82 69 Q64 66 48 66 Z" />
        <circle class="dk-sample" cx="82" cy="63" r="7" />
        <path class="dk-lead" d="M87 57 L104 40" />
        <rect class="dk-tag" x="104" y="30" width="34" height="12" rx="2" />
        <path class="dk-ink" d="M110 36 H132" />
      </svg>
      <p><strong>测盖在上面的钙华</strong>洞壁渗水，会在颜料上慢慢沉积一层钙华。用铀系测年测这层钙华：它形成时，颜料早已在那里，所以得到的是一个最小年龄，画的实际年代可能早得多。</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 120" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect class="dk-layer-a" x="0" y="30" width="160" height="26" />
        <rect class="dk-layer-b" x="0" y="56" width="160" height="26" />
        <rect class="dk-layer-c" x="0" y="82" width="160" height="38" />
        <path class="dk-flake" d="M66 66 L92 62 L98 70 L72 75 Z" />
        <path class="dk-ink" d="M72 70 L90 66 M76 66 L80 73 M83 65 L87 72" />
        <circle class="dk-sample" cx="30" cy="43" r="6" />
        <circle class="dk-sample" cx="130" cy="96" r="6" />
      </svg>
      <p><strong>测它所在的地层</strong>带刻痕或画痕的小物件埋在地层里，可以测它上下或同一层的沉积物和遗物。得到的是这一层的年代，再推断物件的年代；前提是它没有被后来的扰动带进别的层。</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>示意图：三种测年思路的关系，不是任何一处遗址的剖面。真实的取样只取极少量，并要避开颜料本身受到的损伤。</figcaption>
</figure>
